    "CoiStatement": "Compliance with ethical standards This study was approved by the Regional Ethics Committee in Stockholm and the Swedish Medical Products Agency (MPA) EudraCT 2006\u201300,486-34. The study complied with the Declaration of Helsinki of The World Medical Association and the International Conference of Harmonization Guideline of Good Clinical Practice (ICH-GCP, E6). All participants signed an informed consent before the start of the study. Conflict of interest ME has received lecture fees from MSD and AstraZeneca, served as a consultant to Amgen, Sanofi and NovoNordisk and received grant support from MSD. Funding Financial support was provided through the regional agreement on training and clinical research (ALF) between Karolinska Institutet and Stockholm County Council, unrestricted grants from Pfizer and the Swedish Science Council (04496 AR) and funds from the Karolinska Institutet.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "1171-1176"},
      "PublicationTypeList": {"PublicationType": [
